Saucy Fields started the way a lot of good things in a small town do: two friends
with a project and no real plan to make it a business. We were already at every
local show we could get to, and the bands we knew kept needing merch that looked as
good as their music. So we started drawing it and printing it ourselves. Word got
around, and now we print for businesses and one-off events around town too.

We're based in **Winona, Minnesota**. Everything is screen-printed by hand in small
runs — which means we care what goes on the shirt, and we'd rather print a hundred
great ones than a thousand forgettable ones.

Got something you want printed? [Here's how that works](/services). Just want a
shirt? [The shop's right here](/shop).
